{"version":1,"content":"<p>有啲人小器又記仇，得罪佢哋真係有排煩，AV業界資深人士神仙乙更明確表示，只要有睇過AV，就會意識到女人係唔可以亂咁得罪，事關佢哋嘅報復手法相當入肉，往往令仇家喺床上冇晒反抗意志，任人魚肉。</p><p>不過，當中亦有人非但報復失敗，甚至被對方反攻，真係慘</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:12.254514+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.527276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.527276+00:00","content_hash":"fefbe48da0f6a24d73bad6161d5c4e712eb7b35055285d15b299d950c67fa2ae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}